      ],
      "id": "99bb0e0b-aadc-4c5b-8cf1-367983d400b0",
      "name": "Code in JavaScript3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Office AI Assistant\n\nAn AI assistant for Gmail, Google Calendar, Google Tasks, Google Docs, Google Sheets and Google Drive. It runs on GPT-5-mini with short-term memory.\n\n\n**Two ways to use it**\n- **Chat:** Talk to the assistant in the n8n chat window. It can read and draft emails, manage calendar events and tasks, read documents and log notes to sheets.\n- **Daily briefing (manual run):** Edit Fields sets a prompt for the agent, which pulls the last 24 hours of unread emails (oldest first), today's events and today's tasks. A parser Code node turns the result into structured data, and a second Code node formats it as an HTML email. Gmail then sends it to your inbox.\n\n\n**Flow:** Manual trigger → Edit Fields (prompt) → AI Agent → If (manual run only) → parse → build HTML → send email.\n\n\n**Setup:** Select your credentials (OpenAI, Google, Gmail) on any node showing a warning. Replace the Google Sheet and Task list IDs with your own.",
